    "2026-11-25T17:44Z: the first two calls showed that the account posts a call late. The answer to heart-bed take 1 stated 220 and the account had not moved 5 s after it. It read 2,426 at 17:44:17Z and 2,646 at 17:44:27Z, half a minute after the call. From then on a call is counted by the cost its answer states, and the two readings of the account are kept as the check.",
